  "fields": {
    "responsibility": "Close historical output byte delivery across the existing publication producer, actual immutable Git source reader and archive/causal/environment native-review consumers; preserve the original byte requirement without restoring Cache-only transcripts.",
    "retired": "Assumption that a declared archival transcript must still be a current checkout file; replace file-presence authority with explicit per-origin immutable source identity and one-review byte custody.",
    "validation": "83/83 scoped complete cases, zero skips: source8, output7 and68 actual sealed policy cases. All21 path/hash sources and6 canonical bridge callers checked. NUL/nonUTF8, missing/wrong object/path/origin/count, physical corruption, summary-only and publication-race controls refuse. Editable-code origin denial was retained, then candidate qualified through original immutable seal/domain. Exact completed native domain reused through source/test/engine/artifact/child/queue/owner checks. Auxiliary full3-case linker manifest retains identical one failure on6fa and candidate with unchanged source inputs.",
    "benefits": "Actual declared archival bytes remain independently available from reachable Git history while every prior observation hash/status/origin and archive/budget/campaign/causal predicate stays intact. No new registry, transcript copies, inference substitute or execution authority. Full remote defects are explicitly recorded rather than hidden by early preflight denial.",
    "costs": "21 per-origin Git descriptors, actual object/hash/count reads and one-review byte storage; referenced corpus260719 bytes is not total peak. One existing execution-seal instance used544 copy-on-write role transfers and0 byte-copy transfers; no extra C workspace/build, heap, wait or timeout. Runtime performance and total RSS unmeasured.",
    "process": "Whole output-custody support unit on6fa, progressDelta0; architecture3/4, independent SMP1/12 unchanged. Full framework2403 executions against2414 expected with40 failure/31 error/2 skip and11 absent IDs remains DENY; all71 failure/error events remain open in6 diagnostic families, not causally waived.",
    "checklist": "dev/refactoring/modern-c/output-byte-custody.org#output-byte-custody",
    "models": "Native SysML declares producer/reader/consumer custody, retained-linker source/input equivalence, six open remote families and five ASCENT gates, deriving D2. Existing QNT schedule and Lean algebra obligations remain distinct, unchanged and not duplicated. Real byte/host/source refinement is not a hash or filesystem theorem.",
    "open": "Fresh remote source acceptance remains required. Current6fa five module jobs pass, two historical review refusals and real tfib timeout/allocator failure remain failed. No scheduler diagnosis/patch or inherited repair credit. Two other bootstrap log origins remain ambiguous; historical redaction/original-parent/log association gaps are preserved. Both hosted macOS reruns remain queued with no latest jobs; local linker comparison and prior ABBA do not attribute hosted issue216. Fourth integration is not admitted."
  },
